152
00:06:49,476 --> 00:06:51,679
Sólo quiero que me dejen en paz.

153
00:06:53,781 --> 00:06:56,150
[música suave]

154
00:06:56,183 --> 00:07:03,190
♪♪

155
00:07:04,625 --> 00:07:06,861
