222
00:09:45,086 --> 00:09:47,655
[música oscura]

223
00:09:47,688 --> 00:09:48,355
[pájaros cantando]

224
00:09:48,389 --> 00:09:51,058
[tema musical]

225
00:09:51,092 --> 00:09:56,664
[niños]
♪ Él es un unicornio.
de una tierra mágica ♪

226
00:09:56,697 --> 00:10:01,302
♪ Y llamamos su nombre
cuando necesitamos una mano ♪

227
00:10:01,335 --> 00:10:06,841
♪ Él es un amigo
quien sabe nuestros nombres ♪

228
00:10:06,874 --> 00:10:11,345
♪ Él es el rey
de diversión y juegos ♪

229
00:10:11,378 --> 00:10:12,680
♪♪

230
00:10:12,713 --> 00:10:13,981
♪ Es amigo

231
00:10:14,014 --> 00:10:15,249
♪ Oh, amigo

232
00:10:15,282 --> 00:10:17,785
♪ Nuestro amigo hasta el final

233
00:10:17,818 --> 00:10:21,422
♪ Es amigo ♪

234
00:10:21,455 --> 00:10:24,024
[dados traqueteando]

235
00:10:24,058 --> 00:10:25,693
[música suave]

236
00:10:25,726 --> 00:10:28,896
[Oliver]
Uno, dos, tres.

237
00:10:28,929 --> 00:10:30,197
Tres, cinco.

238
00:10:30,231 --> 00:10:31,932
[estornudos]

239
